    "Allocated sizes are estimates. Hard-link attribution, shared blocks and sparse files can affect changes; these values are not reclaimable space. An item seen in only one analysis is not proof of creation or deletion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allocated sizes are estimates. Hard-link attribution, shared blocks and sparse files can affect changes; these values are not reclaimable space. An item seen in only one analysis is not proof of creation or deletion."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分配容量为估算值。硬链接归属、共享块和稀疏文件可能影响差值；这些数值不代表可释放空间。仅在一次分析中出现不证明项目被创建或删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
