          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个配置方案都包含主模型。开启决策服务可协助节省 token；关闭后由主模型接管。密钥保存在本地私有存储中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each instance has its own data directory, configuration, port and socket. Creating one never imports or reinitializes an existing data directory.": {
