          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先停止相关工具和构建任务。离线工作流可能需要重新下载依赖包。保留已安装工具、项目源码和配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop affected tools and builds first. Offline workflows may need downloads again. Installed tools, credentials, configuration and project sources are retained; protected descendants still block cleanup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
